<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in</p>
<p>the $1 million European Community tennis championship on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Johan Van Herck (Belgium) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 4-6</p>
<p>7-5 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 7-6 (10-8)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Dick Norman (Belgium) beat 5-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 6-3 1-6 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6)</p>
</text>
